<h1>Rivet Notes</h1>
<p class="status-row"><span class="badge badge-alpha">Alpha</span></p>
<p>
  Early alpha. Markdown notes kept in plain folders, built on the same shared parts as Rivet Files
  and Rivet FTP: theme and desktop colors, icons, fonts, and in-app windows. It is written in Rust
  and egui, with no GTK or Qt.
</p>
<p>
  It is not ready for daily use. Things are missing, change without notice, or break. There is no
  release and no package yet. Build it from source, and try it on a copy of notes you have backups of.
</p>

