<p>The project notes list these, among others. F1 is not how this app lists them. The full table is in the docs.</p>
<div class="keys">
  <div>
    <dt><kbd>Ctrl</kbd>+<kbd>N</kbd></dt>
    <dd>New note. Shift+Ctrl+N makes a folder.</dd>
  </div>
  <div>
    <dt><kbd>Ctrl</kbd>+<kbd>S</kbd></dt>
    <dd>Save now.</dd>
  </div>
  <div>
    <dt><kbd>Ctrl</kbd>+<kbd>Space</kbd></dt>
    <dd>Reading view. Esc closes it.</dd>
  </div>
  <div>
    <dt><kbd>Ctrl</kbd>+<kbd>P</kbd></dt>
    <dd>Quick Open.</dd>
  </div>
  <div>
    <dt><kbd>Shift</kbd>+<kbd>Ctrl</kbd>+<kbd>P</kbd></dt>
    <dd>Quick Actions.</dd>
  </div>
  <div>
    <dt><kbd>F11</kbd></dt>
    <dd>Peek.</dd>
  </div>
  <div>
    <dt><kbd>Ctrl</kbd>+<kbd>D</kbd></dt>
    <dd>Daily note, when that module is on.</dd>
  </div>
</div>

